   "source": "<a id=\"target-encoding\"></a>\n### 3.2 高级编码：目标编码与防泄漏\n\n高基数类别（几千个城市）用独热会产生海量列。**目标编码**把类别替换为该类别\n的目标均值（回归）或违约率（分类），维度低、信息量大，竞赛常用。但它有\n明显的**泄漏风险**：直接用全量数据算均值，类别编码里就包含了验证/测试信息。\n正确做法是 **OOF（out-of-fold）目标编码**：每一折只用训练折的均值编码。\n\n下面用小数据对比两种做法与目标的相关系数。"
  },
  {
   "id": "8baa647af0844d17ad39dd172f661614",
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 11,
   "metadata": {
    "execution": {
     "iopub.status.busy": "2026-08-07T09:14:37.430551Z",
     "iopub.execute_input": "2026-08-07T09:14:37.431030Z",
     "shell.execute_reply": "2026-08-07T09:14:37.453154Z",
     "iopub.status.idle": "2026-08-07T09:14:37.454485Z"
    }
   },
   "outputs": [
    {
     "output_type": "stream",
     "name": "stdout",
     "text": "朴素（泄漏）目标编码与目标的相关: 0.804\nOOF 目标编码与目标的相关: 0.7675\n泄漏让编码虚高：朴素编码的相关更高，但测试时不可复现\n"
    }
   ],
   "source": "rng_te = np.random.default_rng(7)\nn_te = 300\ncategory_te = rng_te.choice(\n    [\"A\", \"B\", \"C\", \"D\"],\n    size=n_te,\n    p=[0.4, 0.3, 0.2, 0.1],\n)\nprobability_map = {\"A\": 0.75, \"B\": 0.45, \"C\": 0.3, \"D\": 0.15}\ny_te = (\n    np.array([probability_map[c] for c in category_te])\n    + rng_te.normal(0, 0.08, n_te)\n) > 0.4\ny_te = y_te.astype(int)\n\n# 做法 1：朴素目标编码（全量均值，泄漏）\ncategory_series = pd.Series(category_te)\nnaive_encoded = category_series.map(\n    pd.Series(y_te).groupby(category_series).mean()\n).values\n\n# 做法 2：OOF 目标编码（每折只用训练折均值）\noof_encoded = np.zeros(n_te)\nfold_indices = np.array_split(np.arange(n_te), 3)\nglobal_mean = y_te.mean()\nfor validation_idx in fold_indices:\n    train_mask = np.ones(n_te, dtype=bool)\n    train_mask[validation_idx] = False\n    train_frame = pd.DataFrame({\n        \"category\": category_te[train_mask],\n        \"y\": y_te[train_mask],\n    })\n    fold_means = train_frame.groupby(\"category\")[\"y\"].mean()\n    oof_encoded[validation_idx] = pd.Series(\n        category_te[validation_idx]\n    ).map(fold_means).fillna(global_mean).values\n\nnaive_corr = np.corrcoef(naive_encoded, y_te)[0, 1]\noof_corr = np.corrcoef(oof_encoded, y_te)[0, 1]\nprint(\"朴素（泄漏）目标编码与目标的相关:\", round(naive_corr, 4))\nprint(\"OOF 目标编码与目标的相关:\", round(oof_corr, 4))\nprint(\n    \"泄漏让编码\" + (\"虚高\" if naive_corr > oof_corr else \"不成立\")\n    + \"：朴素编码的相关更高，但测试时不可复现\"\n)"
  },
