   "source": "<a id=\"validate\"></a>\n## 6. 验证与防泄漏\n\n<a id=\"leakage\"></a>\n### 6.1 数据泄漏演示：全量预处理是错的\n\n最常见的泄漏错误：**先在全量数据上做预处理（缩放、选择、编码），再做\n交叉验证**。这样验证折的“信息”已经进入训练过程，分数虚高且不可复现。\n正确做法是把预处理放进 Pipeline，让每一折都在训练折内重新 fit。\n\n下面用“全量特征选择后再 CV”与“选择步骤放进 Pipeline”对比。"
  },
  {
   "id": "2a6648586bdb4bf9b28eeca039410380",
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 16,
   "metadata": {
    "execution": {
     "iopub.status.busy": "2026-08-07T09:15:05.082793Z",
     "iopub.execute_input": "2026-08-07T09:15:05.083340Z",
     "shell.execute_reply": "2026-08-07T09:15:05.359429Z",
     "iopub.status.idle": "2026-08-07T09:15:05.360807Z"
    }
   },
   "outputs": [
    {
     "output_type": "stream",
     "name": "stdout",
     "text": "泄漏做法 CV ROC-AUC: [0.8011 0.7989 0.7967 0.7411 0.77  ] 平均: 0.7816\n正确做法 CV ROC-AUC: [0.8033 0.7633 0.7233 0.7467 0.7578] 平均: 0.7589\n"
    },
    {
     "output_type": "display_data",
     "metadata": {},
     "data": {
      "text/plain": "<Figure size 650x400 with 1 Axes>",
      "image/png": ""
     }
    }
   ],
   "source": "from sklearn.datasets import make_classification\nfrom sklearn.feature_selection import SelectKBest, f_classif\nfrom sklearn.linear_model import LogisticRegression\nfrom sklearn.model_selection import cross_val_score\nfrom sklearn.pipeline import make_pipeline\n\nX_leak, y_leak = make_classification(\n    n_samples=300,\n    n_features=40,\n    n_informative=4,\n    n_redundant=0,\n    n_repeated=0,\n    random_state=42,\n)\n\n# 泄漏做法：全量选择后再交叉验证\nselector_full = SelectKBest(f_classif, k=8).fit(\n    X_leak,\n    y_leak,\n)\nX_leak_selected = selector_full.transform(X_leak)\nleaky_scores = cross_val_score(\n    LogisticRegression(max_iter=2000),\n    X_leak_selected,\n    y_leak,\n    cv=5,\n    scoring=\"roc_auc\",\n)\n\n# 正确做法：选择放进 Pipeline，每折内重新 fit\ncorrect_pipeline = make_pipeline(\n    SelectKBest(f_classif, k=8),\n    LogisticRegression(max_iter=2000),\n)\ncorrect_scores = cross_val_score(\n    correct_pipeline,\n    X_leak,\n    y_leak,\n    cv=5,\n    scoring=\"roc_auc\",\n)\n\nprint(\"泄漏做法 CV ROC-AUC:\", np.round(leaky_scores, 4),\n      \"平均:\", round(leaky_scores.mean(), 4))\nprint(\"正确做法 CV ROC-AUC:\", np.round(correct_scores, 4),\n      \"平均:\", round(correct_scores.mean(), 4))\n\nfig, ax = plt.subplots(figsize=(6.5, 4.0))\nax.bar(\n    [\"Leaky (select before CV)\", \"Correct (inside Pipeline)\"],\n    [leaky_scores.mean(), correct_scores.mean()],\n    color=[\"#E45756\", \"#4C78A8\"],\n)\nax.set(\n    ylabel=\"Mean CV ROC-AUC\",\n    title=\"Data Leakage: Inflated Score from Leaky Preprocessing\",\n    ylim=(0, 1),\n)\nax.grid(axis=\"y\", alpha=0.2)\nplt.show()"
  },
